            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "James Mitchell"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this but I made a pretzel crust and used an extra cream cheese and less whipped topping and used fresh strawberries looks great just put it in fridge can't wait to eat it looks so good"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "My Hot Southern Mess"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a rich, sweet treat but like others have said it is missing the cheesecake flavor of most no-bake cheesecakes. After accidentally burning my homemade jam when I walked away for a minute, my husband picked some up at the store. He returned with a seedless variety. This may have added to extra sliding between the layers. I think this would work well if made in a springform pan if making your own crust. Finally, before serving I topped it with fresh strawberries and whipped cream.",
            "datePublished": "2021-06-14T22:31:12.960Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MarieJosephine"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is the second time I have made this Cheesecake, this week! It is super easy, fast and tastes great. I make my own whip cream and crust and use fresh strawberries. There are a lot of great possibilities here!",
            "datePublished": "2014-07-24T19:56:54.453Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Pamela DeAngelo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It was definatly easy to make. I was craving a sweet treat and this was fast and sweet. I only rated it a 3 because I would have liked more of a cream cheese taste. I guess next time I will probably just make a baked cheese cake. Overall, if your looking for a quick sweet, fruity fix this hits the spot.",
            "datePublished": "2014-04-10T22:13:07.947Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tauvia"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This makes a delicious pie, even better when using supreme strawberry topping recipe on top as I did. My kids simply raved about it and my husband enjoyed as well. It is just creamy goodness. I tried a similar recipe years ago that I loved but alas lost. I thought this was it but I was mistaken. However I think the difference may be adding twice as much cream cheese. I will try that next time to see if I can capture the cheesecake taste.",
            "datePublished": "2013-04-27T18:48:53.607Z"
          }
        ],
